{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2022-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1655337600, "end_date": 1655942399, "month_true_total": 152, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:56:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "117432579", "author": {"steamid": "76561198332254761", "personaname": "Solo Khan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198332254761/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 223, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 223, "last_played": 1624739174, "avatar": "679869fe082c3b38446ea932cdd3cfd23b3576df"}, "language": "english", "review": "Loved Mass Effect 1 & 2.\n\nThis POS sucks bilge water thru the ass of a goat.", "timestamp_created": 1655940612, "timestamp_updated": 1655940612, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505640029907226562", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "117425231", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118158668", "personaname": "Azzaxtor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Azzaxtor/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 4936, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3591, "last_played": 1724821637, "avatar": "3d288a6c0e639a5d18426c213580c04648c73a54"}, "language": "english", "review": "After almost 60h of gameplay, i came to a clue that game (Deluxe edition) is done great, yes maybe there are few things that bother me as emotions of characters but still story was good, graphics are great, and so on.\n\nGame is very different than trilogy and thats what i like most about it, its a mixture of MMO game and Sci-Fi shooter. Game is in a different timeline, with ofc features from trilogy game.\n\nSo whoever is thinking of getting it just do not expect trilogy and play it as a NEW game and DIFFERENT game. Play it as it is and do not expect to see Shepard in it, every character is made on a different way and its unique without repeating as Mass Effect 1/2/3(which was not bad but if there was one more similar/same story and way of making it, it would get boring). As i mentioned up it have features of MMO game with also Open World features which is amazing and gives different feeling when playing it.\n\nAbout multiplayer well its still active at least on PC, and i was happy to see that.", "timestamp_created": 1655928609, "timestamp_updated": 1655928609, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "117424113", "author": {"steamid": "76561198423164128", "personaname": "LhazyBear", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LhazyBear/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 7529, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 298, "last_played": 1789234271, "avatar": "c93daabd45a59ecc36a183a922f04027f8d2aacb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Personally I have not hate towards this game. I think the issue is the facial animation at times. But I like how we (as Ryder) are in charge of finding a home instead of in charge of saving the galaxy. Don't get me wrong I adore the triology, but this is refreshing. I have finished this game on my ps4 and got it for pc. So story is 9.5/10", "timestamp_created": 1655927085, "timestamp_updated": 1655927085, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_